{
    ~Open-source
    =Real-time
    ~Java-based
    ~Distributed computing approach
}

::Hadoop Introduction::
Which can best be described as a programming model used to develop Hadoop-based applications that can process massive amounts of data.?
{
    =MapReduce
    ~Mahout
    ~oozie
    ~All of the mentioned
}

